      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "!!! \"Vague recollection\" vs. \"Working memory\" !!!",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "!!! \"Vague recollection\" vs. \"Working memory\" !!!",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LMOMYBu_GKGQ7zgoJYJSN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1869.3880452240978,
      "y": 3270.2279333610527,
      "width": 1520.71142578125,
      "height": 97.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1652217411,
      "version": 262,
      "versionNonce": 1160753389,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1738194972329,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Knowledge in the parameters == Vague recollection (e.g. of something you read 1 month ago)\nKnowledge in the tokens of the context window == Working memory",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Knowledge in the parameters == Vague recollection (e.g. of something you read 1 month ago)\nKnowledge in the tokens of the context window == Working memory",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "i-SRHa1H0eqIBBcMPose6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1877.7866669495725,
      "y": 3477.649437599513,
      "width": 872.2200427861351,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 297112227,
      "version": 1787,
      "versionNonce": 397792419,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1738195676586,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Knowledge of self",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Knowledge of self",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "alpvSb5p8SihLdYVcwY8T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1890.32816175459,
      "y": 3539.2517218714192,
      "width": 1340.1103235556943,
      "height": 291.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1572790851,
      "version": 463,
      "versionNonce": 2122977229,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1738196470064,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The LLM has no knowledge of self \"out of the box\"\nIf you do nothing, it will probably think it is ChatGPT, developed by OpenAI.\nYou can program a \"sense of self\" in ~2 ways:\n- hardcoded conversations around these topics in the Conversations data.\n- \"system message\" that reminds the model at the beginning of every\nconversation about its identity.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The LLM has no knowledge of self \"out of the box\"\nIf you do nothing, it will probably think it is ChatGPT, developed by OpenAI.\nYou can program a \"sense of self\" in ~2 ways:\n- hardcoded conversations around these topics in the Conversations data.\n- \"system message\" that reminds the model at the beginning of every conversation about its identity.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "2pi4Lsv4pgueim67Cj_bs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1877.7557329026304,
      "y": 3912.9578329187348,
      "width": 872.2200427861351,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1931559245,
      "version": 1862,
      "versionNonce": 2047055331,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1738196691002,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Models need tokens to think",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Models need tokens to think",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "a4gdaDC0wZeCtsoq__39y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2043.5353064456676,
      "y": 4018.3166403802984,
      "width": 876.9299335523165,
      "height": 145.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5e",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 203332803,
      "version": 114,
      "versionNonce": 979341603,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1738197131379,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Human: \"Emily buys 3 apples and 2 oranges. Each\norange costs $2. The total cost of all the fruit is $13.\nWhat is the cost of apples?\"",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Human: \"Emily buys 3 apples and 2 oranges. Each orange costs $2. The total cost of all the fruit is $13. What is the cost of apples?\"",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "-HVmTutXrE4bXTsesnVHT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1787.509221651736,
      "y": 4231.1790533219155,
      "width": 637.4197369273902,
      "height": 194.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2036947011,
      "version": 400,
      "versionNonce": 655666499,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1738198794277,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Assistant: \"The answer is $3. This is\nbecause 2 oranges at $2 are $4 total.\nSo the 3 apples cost $9, and therefore\neach apple is 9/3 = $3\".",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Assistant: \"The answer is $3. This is because 2 oranges at $2 are $4 total. So the 3 apples cost $9, and therefore each apple is 9/3 = $3\".",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "uiDzmsHnwT5x30_7r2gH6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2510.5087247587153,
      "y": 4226.838609207802,
      "width": 637.4197369273902,
      "height": 194.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 633332845,
      "version": 614,
      "versionNonce": 2038348259,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1738199121045,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Assistant: \"The total cost of the\noranges is $4. 13 - 4 = 9, the cost of\nthe 3 apples is $9. 9/3 = 3, so each\napple costs $3. The answer is $3\".",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Assistant: \"The total cost of the oranges is $4. 13 - 4 = 9, the cost of the 3 apples is $9. 9/3 = 3, so each apple costs $3. The answer is $3\".",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
